# GitHub Linguist reports a repository by the bytes of every language it
# detects. This system is written in Rust alone; the other tracked files
# are build scripts, test fixtures, linker scripts, reference documents
# and fonts, none of which is part of the system. Detection is off for
# every path and on again for Rust, so a file of a new kind adds no
# language to the bar.
*       -linguist-detectable
*.rs    linguist-detectable
